(
    title: "Dumblin Dungeon",
    developer: Some("DaCookie, Fog Ryû, Hell_666"),
    description: Some("Dumblin Dungeon is a Gameboy multiplayer game, 2+ players. You control a Goblin that must activate buttons in a given order, and in a given timing. If you succeed, tell the next pattern to the next player, and give him the Gameboy. The first pattern is A B C D, walk on the pressure plate with your character to activate it."),
